{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19774","headline":"湘弦怨 · 孟郊","name":"湘弦怨","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昧者理芳草，蒿兰同一锄。\n狂飙怒秋林，曲直同一枯。\n嘉木忌深蠹，哲人悲巧诬。\n灵均入回流，靳尚爲良谟。\n我愿分衆泉，清浊各异渠。\n我愿分衆巢，枭鸾相远居。\n此志谅难保，此情竟何如。\n湘弦少知音，孤响空踟蹰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19774.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19774","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}